  "recap": "The Base Invaders outlasted Bases Loaded 20–15 on Tuesday, August 18, in a slugfest that lived up to both team names. The offense was relentless all night, piling up 25 hits with 11 different players reaching base, and the Invaders' bats simply had the answer every time Bases Loaded threatened to close the gap. Jason powered the attack, going 3-for-3 with a home run and 3 RBI, while Brandon matched him with a 3-for-4 night that included his own long ball and an RBI. Erik chipped in 3-for-5, and Alex N (2-for-3) and Brendan (2-for-2) kept the lineup humming with quality at-bats up and down the card. With this much offense clicking at once, the final margin felt earned rather than lucky, and it added up to a satisfying five-run win.",
